---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home">
  <section class="min-h-[85vh] flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="inline-block uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs text-white/70 border border-white/25 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-8">
        Nutrition &amp; Yoga
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-8">
        Transform Your Health<br class="hidden md:block" /> From The Inside Out
      </h1>
      <div class="mx-auto my-8 h-px w-16 bg-white/50"></div>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/85 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
        I’m Leah, a Registered Associate Nutritionist and Yoga Instructor passionate about helping people feel better through sustainable habits around food, movement, and overall wellbeing. I take a person-centred approach, considering your goals, lifestyle, environment, and circumstances to create realistic changes that work for you.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/services" class="bg-white text-terra-500 px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white/90 transition font-medium">
          Book a Free Discovery Call
        </a>
        <a href="/about" class="border border-white/60 px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition font-medium">
          Learn More About Me
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-white/15">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
        <img src="/images/gen5.jpeg" alt="Leah in a calm lifestyle moment" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-white/60 mb-4">Two disciplines, one approach</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl mb-5">Nutrition and yoga, working together</h2>
        <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Food and movement aren't separate parts of health - they're connected. I bring both
          into one calm, evidence-based approach so you're supported from every angle.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you're here for one-to-one coaching, a private yoga session, or both, everything
          is built around what actually fits your life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-terra-500">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl text-center mb-14">What I Offer</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <a href="/nutrition" class="border border-terra-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:bg-terra-500/5 hover:border-terra-500 transition block">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
            <img src="/images/nut1.jpeg" alt="Nutrition coaching with Leah" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-terra-500">Nutrition Coaching</h3>
          <p class="text-terra-500 text-sm">Personalised, practical plans grounded in evidence.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/yoga" class="border border-terra-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:bg-terra-500/5 hover:border-terra-500 transition block">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
            <img src="/images/yoga22.jpeg" alt="Leah teaching a yoga session" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-terra-500">1:1 &amp; Group Yoga</h3>
          <p class="text-terra-500 text-sm">Mindful movement tailored to your body and goals.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/services" class="border border-terra-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:bg-terra-500/5 hover:border-terra-500 transition block">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
            <img src="/images/gen3.jpeg" alt="Coaching session with Leah" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-terra-500">Coaching Packages</h3>
          <p class="text-terra-500 text-sm">From a free discovery call to ongoing accountability.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
